[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2644047197","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102170#issuecomment-2644047197","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102170","id":2644047197,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dmPVd","user":{"login":"rburing","id":229837,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyOTgzNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/229837?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing","html_url":"https://github.com/rburing","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-07T20:19:26Z","updated_at":"2025-02-07T20:19:26Z","body":"The problem is that Godot calculates the center of mass very incorrectly (making simplifications that just invalid in general):\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/3f56b3b23916ff54a1715cb8444304ce3c50283d/modules/godot_physics_2d/godot_body_2d.cpp#L57-L77\n\nAs a workaround you can set Center of Mass Mode to Custom (and keep the Center of Mass e.g. at the origin of the body).\n\nAlso your generated shape is slightly off center because you rounded incorrectly:\n\n    collision_polygon.position = -bitmap.get_size()*Vector2i(($Sprite2D.scale/2))\n\nIt should be e.g.:\n\n    collision_polygon.position = -Vector2(bitmap.get_size())*$Sprite2D.scale*0.5","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2644047197/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]